# Button

Unstyled button with disabled handling and element delegation.

<div class="demo-card">
	<div class="demo-row">
		<Button class="demo-btn" onclick={() => (buttonClicks += 1)}>Clicked {buttonClicks}×</Button>
		<Button class="demo-btn-outline" disabled>Disabled (not focusable)</Button>
		<Button class="demo-btn-outline" disabled focusableWhenDisabled>Disabled but focusable</Button>
		<Button class="demo-btn-outline" element="div">Div as button (Tab to it, press Enter/Space)</Button>
	</div>
	<p class="demo-note">
		Inspect: native buttons carry <code>type="button"</code>; disabled ones carry
		<code>data-disabled</code>.
	</p>
</div>

